{
  "source": "synthetic (x.3.2 C2, via-p98.3.2): no vendor run. Lines follow the 2026-09-30 c1a-c11b recordings' shapes, trimmed to what the adapter reads. Init arrives only after the prompt line; a gate holds the fake after init and vendor activity, before any model output.",
